{"4420050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Unrealtor", "steam_appid": 4420050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome home to <strong><i>THE UNREALTOR</i></strong>: a couch co-op puzzle adventure game where you and a friend play as Maya and Noah, future roommates trapped in a house tour that spirals into a shifting maze of impossible architecture. To escape this house-tour-from-hell, you’ll work together to solve a series of perspective-based visual puzzles, hunting for split objects that match across your shared screen. Each puzzle solved further transforms the home, unraveling new rooms, bending the laws of physics, and revealing even stranger challenges than before. As you explore deeper, you'll uncover the home’s enigmatic past and, with any luck, find a way out. We hope you enjoy your stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two player mode supports Xbox controllers OR Keyboard and Mouse + one Xbox controller. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode is Keyboard only. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome home to <strong><i>THE UNREALTOR</i></strong>: a couch co-op puzzle adventure game where you and a friend play as Maya and Noah, future roommates trapped in a house tour that spirals into a shifting maze of impossible architecture. To escape this house-tour-from-hell, you’ll work together to solve a series of perspective-based visual puzzles, hunting for split objects that match across your shared screen. Each puzzle solved further transforms the home, unraveling new rooms, bending the laws of physics, and revealing even stranger challenges than before. As you explore deeper, you'll uncover the home’s enigmatic past and, with any luck, find a way out. We hope you enjoy your stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two player mode supports Xbox controllers OR Keyboard and Mouse + one Xbox controlle